```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Patient Arrival at Hospital]) --> CheckReg{Registered in System?}

    CheckReg -- No --> RegisterPatient[Receptionist Enters Demographics<br/>- Name, Age, Phone, Blood Group<br/>- InputValidator Checks]
    RegisterPatient --> CreatePatientRecord[Patient Record Saved<br/>Assigned PAT-ID]
    CheckReg -- Yes --> SearchPatient[Receptionist Searches by Phone/Name/ID]

    CreatePatientRecord --> SelectDoctor[Select Consultant Doctor & Department]
    SearchPatient --> SelectDoctor

    SelectDoctor --> CheckDoctorStatus{Doctor Status Active?}
    CheckDoctorStatus -- No / On Leave --> PickAlternateDoctor[Select Alternate Consultant]
    PickAlternateDoctor --> SelectDoctor

    CheckDoctorStatus -- Yes --> SlotSelection[Select Appointment Date & Time]
    SlotSelection --> ConflictCheck{Slot Clashing with Doctor or Patient?}
    ConflictCheck -- Yes --> SlotConflict[Prompt User to Pick Different Slot]
    SlotConflict --> SlotSelection

    ConflictCheck -- No --> ConfirmBooking[Appointment Booked<br/>Status: SCHEDULED<br/>Audit Log Updated]

    ConfirmBooking --> Consultation[Doctor Consultation Session]
    Consultation --> DoctorActions{Consultation Completed?}
    DoctorActions -- Reschedule Requested --> RescheduleAppt[Reschedule to Future Slot<br/>Status: RESCHEDULED]
    DoctorActions -- Patient Cancelled --> CancelAppt[Cancel Appointment<br/>Status: CANCELLED]
    DoctorActions -- Successful Visit --> CompleteAppt[Enter Clinical & Rx Notes<br/>Status: COMPLETED]

    CompleteAppt --> BillingIntake[Billing Desk Invoicing]
    BillingIntake --> ComputeBill[Compute Breakdown<br/>- Consultation + Services + Meds<br/>- Apply Discount & Tax<br/>- Calculate Final Net Amount]

    ComputeBill --> PaymentProcess{Payment Made?}
    PaymentProcess -- Full Settlement --> SettleFull[Record Payment<br/>Status: PAID<br/>Balance: 0.00]
    PaymentProcess -- Partial Payment --> SettlePartial[Record Payment<br/>Status: PARTIAL<br/>Remaining Balance Due]
    PaymentProcess -- Pending / Credit --> SettlePending[Status: PENDING<br/>Due in Full]

    SettleFull --> PrintInvoice[Generate Printed ASCII Receipt]
    SettlePartial --> PrintInvoice
    SettlePending --> PrintInvoice

    PrintInvoice --> UpdateReports[Update Hospital Daily Revenue & Department Metrics]
    UpdateReports --> End([End of Outpatient Flow])
```
